{"id":"msg_m_ex_blanc_05","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_blanc","label":"Blanc · Nikke"},"label":"5. Pit Boss!","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_blanc_04","next":"msg_m_ex_blanc_06","speakers":{"blanc":"Blanc"},"icons":{"blanc":"si_c270_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_blanc_05_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_05_1","text":"Pit Boss!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_05_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_05_2","text":"The world needs our luck!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_05_3","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_05_3","text":"What does that mean?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_05_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_05_4","text":"Everyone's talking about the new raffle that's going on.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_05_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_05_5","text":"Haven't you heard?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_05_6","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_05_6","text":"First I've heard of it.","jump":"m_ex_blanc_05_8"},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_05_7","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_05_7","text":"I've heard, but I've already spent all my salary.","jump":"m_ex_blanc_05_11"},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_05_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_05_8","text":"No kidding!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_05_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_05_9","text":"Well, if you win the grand prize, you can get a week-long voucher for a 5-star hotel.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_05_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_05_10","text":"The hotel is incredibly expensive, and it's next-to-impossible to get reservations for it.","jump":"m_ex_blanc_05_16"},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_05_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_05_11","text":"I knew that you'd be in the know.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_05_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_05_12","text":"But that's too bad about your salary...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_05_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_05_13","text":"The grand prize is a week-long voucher for a 5-star hotel,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_05_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_05_14","text":"so it's worth throwing your hat in the ring.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_05_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_05_15","text":"The hotel is incredibly expensive, and it's next-to-impossible to get reservations for it.","jump":"m_ex_blanc_05_16"},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_05_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_05_16","text":"I can see why people are abuzz about it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_05_17","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_05_17","text":"Why'd you come to me with this?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_05_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_05_18","text":"Because whenever we've gotten close,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_05_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_05_19","text":"our luck increases","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_05_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_05_20","text":"and all sorts of good things happen.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_05_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_05_21","text":"So I was thinking that we could go and try that raffle together, hehe.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_05_22","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_05_22","text":"Sure, let's go.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_05_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_05_23","text":"All right!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_05_24","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_05_24","text":"But only on one condition.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_05_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_05_25","text":"Oh? What's that?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_05_26","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_05_26","text":"Let's bring Noir with us.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_05_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_05_27","text":"Ah! That's a great idea.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_05_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_05_28","text":"I don't want to end up giving you all my luck","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_05_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_05_29","text":"and jinx myself.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_05_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_05_30","text":"Also, if Noir is with us,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_05_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_05_31","text":"that'll increase your luck twice as much!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_05_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_05_32","text":"However,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_05_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_05_33","text":"if you win the top prize,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_05_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_05_34","text":"you've got to promise to take the two of us with you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_05_35","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_05_35","text":"Naturally.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_05_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_05_36","text":"Okay, then I'll call Noir","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_05_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_05_37","text":"and make the plans.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_05_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_05_38","text":"See you later!! Hehehe.","jump":null}],"chat":true}